# Butter Project Documentation
app ButterCompiler
  description "A specification language that communicates intent to AI agents. Write clean .butter specs, compile to a Markdown prompt, and feed the output to AI agents who produce higher first-pass accuracy."

feature CompilationPipeline
  description "The strictly sequential end-to-end execution flow of the Butter compiler — from lexing and parsing to semantic validation and output generation."
  version "1.9.0"

  params
    input_file string
    output_format enum["prompt", "json", "yaml"]
    output_path string
    check_only boolean

  actions
    # Stage 1: Lexical Analysis (The Off-side Rule)
    "Read file sequentially and track whitespace with a LIFO indentation stack"
    "Emit INDENT token when leading whitespace exceeds stack top"
    "Emit DEDENT tokens when leading whitespace is less than stack top"
    "Emit NEWLINE, IDENTIFIER, STRING, PIPE, EOF, and ERROR tokens"
    "Halt compilation with exit code 1 when an indentation mismatch or lexical error is detected"
    # Stage 2: Recursive Descent Parsing
    "Consume token stream to construct Abstract Syntax Tree (AST)"
    "Map root tokens to the app specification root (app, description, version)"
    "Map nested blocks to feature specifications"
    "Map parameter definitions to typed parameters (string, integer, double, boolean, enum)"
    "Map execution steps to sequential actions"
    "Halt compilation with exit code 1 when a syntax error is detected"
    # Stage 3: Semantic Analysis
    "Check AST for duplicate feature names"
    "Check AST for duplicate parameter names within features"
    "Verify parameter and response field types are valid"
    "Verify HTTP methods and status codes are valid"
    "Emit warning but continue"
    "Halt compilation with exit code 1 when a semantic validation error is found"
    # Stage 4: Output Generation
    "Skip output generation and exit with code 0 when check_only is set"
    "Look up the registered output extension by name from the extension registry"
    "Dispatch serialization to the extension's Serialize method"
    "Write serialized bytes to output path and exit with code 0"
